WEBVTT

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.490
Will your opponent be Akari?

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.410
Or...

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:27.000
You can pick whichever one you'd like.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.610
Yes.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.260
That's...

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.580
Luna-chan!

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:46.130
<b>Like Burning Away</b>

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:48.700
Hurry!

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:24.180
So they did come.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.440
What do you want to do?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.430
We haven't finished 
evacuating the civilians.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.330
We'll have to stall them until then.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:33.090
Yeah...

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:34.750
Let's go!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.570
Is that really Luna?

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.490
But Luna-chan is at her villa.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.950
Stop, Luna-chan! Let's ta—

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:55.560
This isn't the normal Luna.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.130
She's not exactly in the 
state to talk and understand!

00:03:58.130 --> 00:03:59.420
Wait, Seira!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.630
At this rate, she'll kill us. 
I'm going to tame her.

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.710
No, don't!

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.880
Move!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.280
Seira!

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:38.760
Seira!

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.590
Luna-chan, why?

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.610
Seira-oneetan!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.070
Onee-tan...

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.600
There's trouble! Priscilla-san 
and Meltina-san...

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:12.890
Did everyone get away?

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.590
Probably. About time 
we got out of here too.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.560
We need to use the dummy cards

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:18.750
they made for us, huh?

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:21.130
Let's count down, 
and throw them together.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.340
Right.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.800
Three, two...

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:30.510
No!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:31.010
Priscilla?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.110
Priscilla!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.780
If Luna-oneetan was here,

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.710
recovery would be faster 
with her healing powers.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.720
Are you awake?

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.160
I...

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.610
How are you feeling?

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.860
I'm okay. Ow...

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.030
That's...

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.740
That was Luna-chan.

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:32.800
I don't want to believe it,

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:36.460
but she seemed to 
recognize Seira and me.

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:42.270
Actually, last night, there was 
a report from Luna's butler.

00:06:42.270 --> 00:06:44.370
He said that you had 
come to the villa,

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:46.510
and then both of you had disappeared.

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:50.010
Me?! B-But I was...

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.830
We know.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.010
Someone must have gotten to Luna-san by

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.920
taking on your appearance, Akari-san.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.650
The same person is responsible for

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:00.020
the appearance of the counterpart cards

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.770
for Temperance, The Fool and The Magician.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:06.480
This is merely a guess, 
but we're thinking that

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.530
this is all being done by 
a Daemonia with free will.

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:12.470
A Daemonia with free will?

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.050
Its name is Cerebrum.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.040
Huh?

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:18.990
This is the first time I've actually 
spoken to you, Taiyo Akari.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.500
I am Laplace.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.670
I'm Schrödinger, meow.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.680
We are messengers

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.410
from the organization, Leguzario,

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:32.570
which created Sefiro Fiore 
and is sending out the orders

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.050
to exterminate the Daemonia.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.230
Leguzario?

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.360
So does that mean the 
Leguzario have known of

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.440
the existence of the Daemonia 
with free will, Cerebrum?

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.580
We have no obligation to tell you.

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:49.940
We are merely messengers.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.450
When things aren't in your favor, 
you always say that.

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.250
Watch your mouth, Ariel.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:58.630
As long as Luna is being 
controlled by Cerebrum,

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.400
the Leguzario will probably immediately

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:02.460
send out an order to have her killed.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:06.210
You should probably take care 
of things on your own before then.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.010
But! Luna-chan...

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:10.560
I won't do it!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.290
Bear in mind...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.400
Your mission is to 
exterminate the Daemonia.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:19.750
It is forbidden to 
disobey the Leguzario.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.480
Luna is already a Daemonia.

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.240
Seira?

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.820
Is it okay for you
 to be up already?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.740
There's no pain.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.270
I see.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:48.250
They just told me to fight Luna-chan.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.220
Huh?

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.620
But I don't want to do that. I can't.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:59.010
I don't know why Luna-chan 
ended up like that,

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:02.340
but there's got to be 
something that we can do.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.290
Let's save Luna-chan!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.490
If we work together, 
we should be able to...

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.910
Sorry, Akari.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.550
I can't fight anymore.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.490
Huh?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.320
My tarot powers

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.160
have disappeared.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.430
<i>I can't go into the Astralux anymore.</i>

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:46.250
<i>I probably lost my powers 
when I was bitten by Luna.</i>

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:47.940
<i>But...</i>

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.690
<i>I'm sorry. At an important 
time like this,</i>

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.600
<i>I'm useless.</i>

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.620
I'm scared.

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.940
Please don't kill me.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.660
Please...

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:26.660
<i>Ginka, Seira, and Luna-chan 
all aren't here.</i>

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.070
Apparently, it's complicated.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.720
We thought we might be able to give you

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:47.330
Elemental Tarot powers for at 
least a little while, but...

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:51.830
If my Elemental powers don't return...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.880
I-It'll be okay. You 
should get them back.

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.140
We'll investigate a little more.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:57.840
More.

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.750
All right.

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:14.320
Akari, um...

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.110
It's fine.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:18.440
Don't worry.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:23.510
I'll be going now.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.020
Your turn...

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.320
is coming up.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:01.780
Please...

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.280
Kill me.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.410
Please...

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:10.790
<i>Why...</i>

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:13.670
Please!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.250
<i>...am I fighting?</i>

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.020
How's Akari-san?

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.670
This is the fourth day straight 
she's being sent out.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.260
A time like this, and we 
can't even do anything.

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.780
Then why are we here?

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:55.250
If we don't leave our cage, 
I don't think anything will start.

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:58.390
If we leave our cage, we'll 
end up paying for it.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.730
Not only us, but everyone.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:08.800
No matter what happens, 
there is something I have to tell her.

00:13:11.260 --> 00:13:17.760
Though I don't know if it'll truly be 
a good thing for Akari-san or not.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.390
Akari-san...

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.460
Luna-chan!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:44.120
Let's go back together!

00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:46.550
Everyone is waiting for you, Luna-chan!

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:49.600
Everyone?

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.470
Yes, so let's go back!

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.590
Come with me, Akari-san.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:01.860
If you become a Daemonia 
too, we can be together.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.910
Please, Akari-san.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:09.370
I can't.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.620
Why?

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.370
Because I want to save you, Luna-chan!

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:19.380
I want to be with the 
normal Luna-chan!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:24.170
The normal me...

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.810
Luna-chan! What's wrong, Luna-chan?!

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:45.940
Luna-chan!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:48.950
Luna-chan!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.260
Akari-san, run!

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.360
But...

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.390
Please! Hurry!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:06.990
Luna-chan...

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:23.370
Oh? So you still had a bit 
of your human heart left.

00:15:24.740 --> 00:15:29.240
But it's no good if you 
don't act as my pawn.

00:15:37.720 --> 00:15:39.500
Akari-oneetan!

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:42.890
I'm fine. Thanks.

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:44.080
But...

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.220
<i>I couldn't do anything.</i>

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.370
<i>I couldn't save Luna-chan.</i>

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.690
There's something I'd 
like to ask of you.

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.320
That's rare.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:23.530
I'm helping you out because 
of times like this.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:25.520
So, what is it?

00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:27.420
It's an easy task.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:30.120
I just want you to spread 
a little rumor for me.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:39.340
It appears that the Astralux 
is made up of many levels.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:43.100
It appears that there are 
levels that we can't get to.

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.060
To.

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:47.940
The funding to research 
the Astralux

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.770
and Aeon Tarot have been 
cut back and discontinued.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.880
The Leguzario are a bunch 
of stingy meanies.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:55.820
It's true.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:17:01.330
<b>Taiyo Hinata</b>

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:00.830
<i>I can't fight alone anymore.</i>

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:05.670
<i>What should I do, Mom?</i>

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:08.590
Mommy?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.920
Mommy, where are you?

00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:13.630
Mommy!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:20.010
Mommy, where are you?

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.090
Mommy!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:29.860
What's wrong?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:32.980
Did you get separated from your mom?

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:40.620
Do you want me to help 
you find your mom?

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:43.000
Okay!

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.850
I'm telling you, it's true.

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:30.870
I totally heard a wolf howling!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.670
Why would there be a wolf?

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:37.680
I also heard there was one in 
the mountains the other day.

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:38.870
Right?

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:40.300
Are you serious?

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:46.430
I wonder where your mom is.

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.840
I'm sorry. We'll find her soon.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.120
That's not it.

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:54.820
Huh?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.820
I don't really have a mommy.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:08.080
Mommy's gone.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.580
If I go home, there's no one there.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:14.710
I'm all alone now.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:17.900
I'm all alone, too.

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.890
My mom died a long time ago.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:25.880
And my friends are gone, 
so I'm alone right now.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.330
Are you lonely?

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:29.600
Yeah.

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.210
I guess I am.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:34.480
How sad.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:38.740
Do you want me to be your friend?

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.420
Huh?

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:41.360
I'm lonely.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:45.380
Why... I'm scared.... 
I don't want to be alone.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.120
Everyone, come back...

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:57.190
Let's meet here again.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.760
Let's play together.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.750
It's a promise.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.690
Hello?

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:08.940
<i>Akari-oneetan, we're in trouble!</i>

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.730
<i>Please hurry and come back!</i>

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.810
Huh? What do you mean? Hello?

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.250
Oh, I'm sorry! I've got to...

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:48.760
I always thought that a 
fortune-telling school was suspicious.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.270
Who knows what they're doing there.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:55.770
Everything weird that's happened 
in town is all because of them!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.620
They're witches!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:20:59.000
Yeah, they're witches!

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:06.160
What's going on?

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.420
As you can see, it's a mob.

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:12.540
They were probably coerced by Cerebrum.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:17.290
It appears that we have been blamed 
for what the Daemonia have done.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:22.050
He had more influence over the 
human world than we thought, meow.

00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:23.760
But...

00:21:29.900 --> 00:21:31.310
Let us hurry and get away from here.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.930
But where are we going to go?

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.440
I have an idea!

00:22:04.470 --> 00:22:05.450
Let's go!

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.380
<b>Repeating fortunes and misfortunes,
 life and death, and the samsara of all 
living things in the universe.</b>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:42.650
<b>#10 The Wheel of Fortune</b>

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:28.250
I'm Meltina.

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:29.060
And I'm Priscilla.

00:23:29.060 --> 00:23:31.520
What do you like most out of the 
foods that Nagataki's famous for?

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:30.390
<b>Those are things that are likened to a wheel</b>

00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:33.390
<b>The Wheel of Fortune card represents 
a fateful incident, change or chance 
that you cannot run away from.</b>

00:23:31.520 --> 00:23:33.670
Well, Turkish Rice, of course.

00:23:33.390 --> 00:23:35.930
<b>If you were to choose this card, there is 
a chance for a fateful incident, and great 
fortune should soon await you.</b>

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:35.260
I think it'd be shrimp toast for me.

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.660
Shrimp toast? What's that? 
I've never eaten that!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.420
<b>However, if this card is reversed, a
 situation is heading in a direction 
that you do not wish it to.</b>

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:39.210
Hey, when'd you eat it? Hey!

00:23:37.890 --> 00:23:41.390
<b>Your Path</b>

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:40.320
<b>But that is something predestined for 
you, so please accept it, rather than fight it.</b>

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:40.960
See you next time!

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:42.030
<b>Your chance will come some day.</b>

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:43.390
<b></b>
